# Hot-reload e2e (noetl/ai-meta#548 Phase 3): a slow child, re-registered mid-loop.
apiVersion: noetl.io/v2
kind: Playbook
metadata: { name: catalog_hot_child, path: tests/catalog_hot/child }
workflow:
  - step: start
    tool: { kind: shell, command: "sleep 3" }
    next: [ { step: end } ]
  - step: end
    tool: { kind: noop, result: { says: "SAYS" } }
